WEBVTT

00:36:57.751 --> 00:37:01.331
two people sitting across a table
lying to each other for a couple hours.

00:37:01.355 --> 00:37:03.290
AG: (Laughs) Do you think it's that bad?

00:37:03.314 --> 00:37:05.812
Man: I think we're all trying
to puff each other up.

00:37:05.836 --> 00:37:07.598
AG: Should we kill the job interview

00:37:07.622 --> 00:37:08.915
or reinvent it?

00:37:08.939 --> 00:37:11.522
(Theme music)

00:37:13.210 --> 00:37:15.286
AG: WorkLife is hosted by me, Adam Grant.

00:37:15.310 --> 00:37:17.696
The show is produced by TED
with Transmitter Media.

00:37:17.720 --> 00:37:20.776
Our team includes Colin Helms,
Gretta Cohn, Dan O'Donnell

00:37:20.800 --> 00:37:22.896
Constanza Gallardo, Grace Rubenstein,

00:37:22.920 --> 00:37:25.806
Michelle Quint, Angela Cheng
and Anna Phelan.

00:37:25.830 --> 00:37:28.106
This episode was produced
by Jessica Glazer.

00:37:28.130 --> 00:37:29.786
Our show is mixed by Rick Kwan.

00:37:29.810 --> 00:37:32.936
Original music by Hansdale Hsu
and Allison Leyton-Brown